libomp provides the OpenMP runtime that AppleClang doesn't ship

If CMake's find_package(OpenMP) doesn't pick it up automatically on your
triplet, point it at the vcpkg install prefix:

    find_package(OpenMP REQUIRED)
    #or, if that also fails so maybe locate it:
    set(OpenMP_ROOT "${VCPKG_INSTALLED_DIR}/<triplet>")
